# How a host caches this site (Cloudflare Pages / Netlify syntax; build_web.py's cacheControlFor is the
# same rule for --serve, and web/README.md spells it for other hosts). Later rules override earlier ones.
# Only the versioned module folders are immutable: every other path, the vendored third party and the
# current module included, keeps its name when its content changes, so it revalidates and 304s instead.

/*
  Cache-Control: no-cache
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp

/wasm/:version/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
